with modern pill badges.\n   - Clean 4-column KPI metric cards with high-contrast icons and typography.\n\n3. **Responsive Breakpoints**:\n   - At wide viewports ($>1080\\text{px}$): Balanced side-by-side columns with no overlapping text.\n   - At smaller viewports ($\\le 1080\\text{px}$): Clean single-column layout with consistent padding and no cramped text.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to View the Updated UI\nOpen [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) in your browser (or press refresh if already open). The dashboard now opens into an airy, uncluttered layout with balanced spatial proportions."}
